"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-21T18:39:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:38Z","closed_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122703","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122703.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122703.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:27Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nImproves the compression performance by using component swizzling for luminance formats and allowing RGB textures to be sampled directly when the hardware supports it.\r\nAdditionally, the texture usage bitflags have been narrowed down to only the necessary minimum.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Ensure the luminance swizzling works for all Betsy formats,\r\n- [x] Test on an Intel iGPU to ensure the RGB sampling works correctly. - [Intel UHD Graphics 620 (WHL GT2)](https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/displayreport.php?id=44245)\r\n- [x] Post the performance results\r\n- [x] Decide on what to do with the direct RGB sampling optimization\r\n\r\n### Results:\r\nSystem: Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma) on Wayland\r\nGPU: integrated Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620 (WHL GT2)\r\nCPU: Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8665U CPU @ 1.90GHz (8 threads)\r\nRAM: 16 GB\r\n\r\n| Format | master | this PR |\r\n|---------|---------|---------|\r\n| 2048x2048 L8 | 20 ms | 9ms |\r\n| 2048x2048 LA8 | 25ms | 15ms |\r\n| 2048x2048 RGB8 | 16ms | 11ms |\r\n| 2048x2048 RGB16 | 20ms | 29ms |\r\n| 2048x2048 RGBH | 20ms | 30ms |\r\n| 2048x2048 RGBF | 60ms | 54ms |\r\n\r\nMostly as expected in terms of the luminance formats, thought the 8-bit and 32-bit formats only show an improvement of ~5ms. The 16-bit ones have actually regressed as they take 10ms more. \r\nI'll probably end up removing the direct RGB sampling since it doesn't improve the performance as much as I would have liked.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122703/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122703/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}